### TEST CASE 1: Register a New Student Profile
POST http://localhost:5000/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json
 
{
  "email": "amber.student@brightminds.com",
  "password": "SecurePassword123",
  "role": "STUDENT"
}
 
### TEST CASE 1B: Send the EXACT same request again (duplicate email must be blocked)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json
 
{
  "email": "amber.student@brightminds.com",
  "password": "SecurePassword123",
  "role": "STUDENT"
}
 
### TEST CASE 1C: Register WITHOUT an email (validation must fail)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json
 
{
  "password": "SecurePassword123",
  "role": "STUDENT"
}

### TEST CASE 2: Attempt Login with Bad Credentials (Should Fail)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json
 
{
  "email": "amber.student@brightminds.com",
  "password": "WrongPasswordHere"
}
 
### TEST CASE 3: Login with Correct Registered Credentials (Should Pass)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json
 
{
  "email": "amber.student@brightminds.com",
  "password": "SecurePassword123"
}

